    "final_answer": "It sounds incredibly difficult and exhausting to be in a place where you\u2019ve reached your limit, and it\u2019s valid to feel worn down. Think first about whether this is a matter of unhappiness or a safety concern in any way. If there\u2019s ever an element of abuse or feeling unsafe, your safety is the absolute priority, and reaching out to immediate support networks is vital.\n\nSpending time with a therapist can help you sorts through where you\u2019re at and guide your next steps. You don\u2019t have to make drastic decisions right away unless there\u2019s imminent danger. Lean on your friends and family to provide you support, even if just listening to your feelings. Taking it slow and focusing on your own well-being is key as you explore the best path for yourself.",
